# SQL POLICY: never ignore *.sql. supabase/migrations/**, supabase/schema.sql, supabase/seed.sql and supabase/tests/** MUST stay trackable (commit f2dedd4 hid the whole schema from git). Data dumps contain PII (leads, auth users): never commit them.
*.dump
*.backup
*.sql.bak
*.sql.gz
/backups/
/dump*.sql
/backup*.sql
*_data_dump.sql

